<style> .s_pv9W5WOpV{transform-origin: center top !important;transform: scale(1) !important;width: 100% !important;padding: 0px !important;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255) !important;} .s_ZwLkWkYdV{position: relative !important;margin: 0px 0px 13px !important;padding: 0px !important;border-width: 0px !important;background-color: transparent !important;border-radius: 0px !important;} .s_yNwA5AOMY{position: relative !important;} .s_JkGwDwY0d{color:#222222 !important;} .s_Ko8JPJYzV{padding: 8px 16px !important;} .s_BqPEMEVRA{padding-left: 16px !important;padding-right: 16px !important;} .s_v2pb5bKkP{display: none !important;}</style> 
<div class="wp-content wp-theme-cdh wp-m-w100 deployed s_pv9W5WOpV wp-desktop"> 
 <div class="wpc wpc-text wc_titH2 s_ZwLkWkYdV" data-theme="wc_titH2"> 
  <h2>공시자료 작성, 관리 및 주관부서 연락처</h2> 
 </div> 
 <div class="wpc wpc-text s_yNwA5AOMY"> 
  <p><span class="s_JkGwDwY0d">본 상품공시실에 공시되는 내용은 아래의 담당부서에서 작성하고 있으며, 관련부서의 검수를 받아 홈페이지에 게시되고 있습니다.</span></p> 
